msgstr "![Wynik poprzedniej komórki kodu](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/0c8397a3-f9bc-42c5-b872-caec6dc4396b-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have now estimated all components of $\\vec{r}$ and can write out the full vector.\n"
msgstr "Oszacowaliśmy teraz wszystkie składowe $\\vec{r}$ i możemy zapisać pełny wektor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You obtained the estimation of the original random vector fairly accurately using this quantum state tomography method.\n"
